                    <p>
                        Callers compare codes, not prose. Missing input, revision
                        conflicts and unwired capabilities each keep one stable
                        code, today including <code>capability/not-implemented</code>.
                    </p>
                </article>
                <article class="contract">
                    <div class="contract__top">
                        <h3>Per-format matrix</h3>
                        <span class="chip chip--accent">declared</span>
