                        <li>Styles resolve by name instead of being copied into every paragraph.</li>
                        <li>Edits run as transactions, so a failed change leaves no half document.</li>
                        <li>No authoring call reaches a live document handle yet.</li>
                    </ul>
                </article>
                <article class="area">
                    <div class="area__top">
                        <h3>Template fill</h3>
                        <span class="chip">not implemented</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Named placeholders report filled, skipped or ambiguous.</li>
                        <li>Long values report overflow per section instead of shrinking text.</li>
